================================================================================
                   AUTOMATIC BASKETBALL GOAL COUNTER
================================================================================

SYSTEM OVERVIEW:
This algorithm controls an optical sensor system placed inside a basketball net
to automatically track points scored during a match.


SYSTEM PARAMETERS & VARIABLES:
* S_total     : Integer (Holds total score, initial value = 0)
* sensorState : Enum (Optical beam status: CLEAR or BROKEN)
* t           : Integer (System clock tick in seconds)


=========================== MAIN ALGORITHM FLOW ===========================

                     [ START ]
                         |
                         v
               /   Is t % 1 == 0?   \
              /                      \
             +------------------------+
               |                    |
            ( YES )               ( NO )
               |                    |
               v                    v
  / Is sensorState == BROKEN? \   [ Wait 1 sec / t + 1 ]
 /                             \    |
+-------------------------------+   |
  |                           |     |
( YES )                     ( NO )  |
  |                           |     |
  v                           v     v
[ S_total = S_total + 2 ]   [ Keep current score ]
[ Update Display ]            |     |
  |                           |     |
  +------------->-------------+     |
                 |                  |
                 v                  v
         +-------<------------------+
         |
         v
  ( Loop to START )

===========================================================================


STEP-BY-STEP LOGIC EXECUTION:

1. INITIALIZATION
   - Set S_total = 0
   - Set sensorState = CLEAR
   - Set system timer t = 0

2. MAIN TIMING LOOP
   - Evaluate condition: Is t % 1 == 0?
     * NO  : Wait 1 second, set t = t + 1, return to Step 2.
     * YES : Proceed to Step 3 (Check Routine).

3. CHECK ROUTINE (checkGoal)
   - Read hardware state from optical sensor.
   - Evaluate condition: Is sensorState == BROKEN?
     * YES : 1. Increment total score: S_total = S_total + 2
             2. Send update command to the digital scoreboard display.
             3. Reset sensor state back to CLEAR.
     * NO  : Maintain current S_total value without changes.

4. LOOP CONTINUATION
   - Return to Step 2 to await the next timing cycle.

================================================================================
